{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01WzwbnWpd1xUu2zEzuLGCKu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Session Summary â€” `anchor_gui.py`\n\n**Goal / what this deliverable is**\n- `anchor_gui.py` is the Anchor application: a self-contained Python **stdlib-only HTTP server** (`http.server.ThreadingHTTPServer` + `BaseHTTPRequestHandler`) that serves the interactive dashboard and writes every change directly to the markdown files (`anchor_gui.py:16-21`, module docstring `:1-14`).\n- It is an **8,093-line single file** with no third-party imports in its own code path â€” only `json, logging, os, re, socket, sys, threading, time, traceback, webbrowser, datetime, pathlib, http.server, urllib.parse, html` (`:16-21`).\n\n**Architecture (grounded in the symbol map)**\n- **Paths layer** resolves all data files through the shared `paths` helper honoring `ANCHOR_DATA_DIR`, with a process-wide `WRITE_LOCK` held around every mutation to keep concurrent threaded requests from losing updates (`:27-47`).\n- **Markdown parsing/serialization**: `parse_tasks_from_md`, `serialize_task_line`, `parse_projects_from_md`, `parse_inbox_from_md`, `parse_archived_tasks`, unified by `gather_all` (`:181-386`).\n- **Change operations** (all wrapped by `_with_write_lock`): `mark_done`, `mark_undone`, `add_task`, `capture_inbox`, `link_task`, `edit_task`, `edit_project`, `cancel_task`, `save_for_later`, `restore_task`, plus `log_change` (`:3885-4318`).\n- **Dashboard HTML** is built by one large `generate_html(projects, tasks, inbox)` function with embedded CSS/JS and nested helpers (`esc`, `linkify_notes`, `notes_popover`, `task_data_b64`, `top_task_row`, `project_card`, `task_item`) (`:4320-4504`).\n- **HTTP layer**: `AnchorHandler` with `do_GET` (`:6677`) and `do_POST` (`:7159`) routing, JSON/HTML/bytes/SSE send helpers, and a single-instance `_ExclusiveThreadingHTTPServer` that binds via `server_bind` for the `SO_EXCLUSIVEADDRUSE` 8777 guard (`:7941-7997`); `main()` at `:8019`.\n\n**R&D control surface (v2â†’v4) carried in this file**\n- **WebSocket codec (stdlib, hand-rolled RFC-6455)**: `ws_accept_key`, `encode_text_frame`, `encode_close_frame`, `encode_pong_frame`, `_encode_frame`, `decode_frames` â€” backing the ConPTY terminal transport (`:463-633`).\n- **Traversal-safe static asset routes**: `anchor_term_asset`, `xterm_asset`, `brand_asset` with `_unsafe_path_seg` guard (`:634-750`).\n- **Project lifecycle / discovery**: `open_project_instance`, `close_project_instance`, `_maybe_git_init`, `create_new_folder_project`, `select_existing_project`, `discover_and_adopt` (`:751-904`).\n- **Proactive summaries run in background threads** (never on the render path): `_trigger_project_summary`, `_trigger_session_summary`, `_trigger_project_session_summaries`, each with an inner `_run()` thread (`:905-1022`).\n- **v3/v4 rendering**: `render_project_window_html` is the dominant block (`:1856-3645`, ~1,800 lines) â€” the cockpit project window; supported by `render_status_line_html`, `render_project_tile_html`, `_render_kanban_html`, `_render_grass_board`, `_render_lane_sessions` (with `_lane_tile`/`_render_session_card`), and the cost/rollup renderers `_fmt_rollup_line`, `render_header_rollup_html`, `_fmt_cost`, `render_cost_rollup_html`, `render_deliverables_html`, `ensure_anchor_deliverable` (`:1024-3885`).\n- **Terminal SSE/WS server endpoints**: `_serve_term_sse`, `_serve_term_stream2`, `_serve_term_ws`, gated by `_term_token_ok` (`:6315-6676`).\n\n**Findings**\n- The file is the integration hub for the whole R&D surface â€” it imports the v2/v3/v4 backend modules and exposes them as routes, but the heavy logic (sessions, summarizer, registry, worktrees, deliverables) lives in sibling modules, keeping this file as the HTTP + HTML rendering layer.\n- A single `render_project_window_html` accounts for roughly 22% of the file; its window JS is a raw (single-brace) string, consistent with the documented f-string-escaping pitfall.\n\n**Errors**\n- None observed â€” this is a static read of the source; no runtime/test execution was part of this session, so no error claims are made.\n\n*(Grounded in `C:\\dev\\Anchor\\anchor_gui.py`; line references from the file's symbol map and header.)*"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":638,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3807,"cache_read_input_tokens":48906,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3807},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"476af7c4-82d0-4148-85e7-55e7dbe4d8cf","uuid":"96cca63f-4ee1-4a61-af9f-421df80882b2","request_id":"req_011Cc1H9n9QxjTyB8QSeHuiJ"}
